		</choice>
	</event>
	<event name="SYLVAN_ROYAL_LEAH_DIALOGUE_2">
		<text>"-ment? I mean, just think about it! Wouldn't it be so cool to have our legendary rivalry, which you ended, you beyatch, end with both of our deaths? Like one of those death-to-alien-races morality videos you see all the time, it'd be one of those epic themes about how violence is only sometimes the answer, and- Ooh! We can include one of those 'it's about the journey, not the reward'-type of deals as well! Don't you think that'd be such a fitting end to our rivalry, by the way, you're still a beyatch for that, since it spanned so long, we might as well include th-"</text>
		<choice hidden="true">
